{"seq":3,"slug":"defect-class-critical-major-minor","title":"缺陷分级判定：致命/严重/轻微缺陷的实操界定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/aql-sampling-plan/defect-class-critical-major-minor","wordCount":3214,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"缺陷分级判定-致命-严重-轻微缺陷的实操界定\">缺陷分级判定：致命/严重/轻微缺陷的实操界定</h1><p>同一件陶瓷杯上的针孔、把手松动、内壁釉面含铅超标——在 AQL 报告上会被写成三个不同类别，落进三条互不相干的验收通道：针孔是次要（Minor），把手松动是主要（Major），含铅超标是关键（Critical）。**缺陷分级的本质不是描述瑕疵有多难看，而是把每一个可疑点映射到&quot;能否放行&quot;和&quot;出问题后谁担责&quot;上。**一个 3500 件的批次可能因 12 个次要缺陷照常放行，却因 1 个关键缺陷整批退回——因为两者查的根本不是同一张接收数表。分级错了，后面所有抽样数字都是错的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>分级判定挂在四个词上，先把它们的含义钉死，后面的争议和法规才有落脚点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>为什么重要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缺陷类别（Class）</td>\n<td>关键 / 主要 / 次要三档</td>\n<td>决定该点走哪条 AQL 通道</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检验规范（SI）</td>\n<td>逐条写死判定条款的现场文件</td>\n<td>把主观分歧转成可核查条款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>接收数 / 拒收数（Ac/Re）</td>\n<td>某类别在某 AQL 下的判定阈值</td>\n<td>三类缺陷各有一对，同时判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>零容忍（c=0）</td>\n<td>出现 1 件关键缺陷即拒收</td>\n<td>标准表无 AQL=0 列，需专门方案</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>&quot;分类&quot;是动作，&quot;判定&quot;是结果。</strong> 分类把现场看到的一个现象指派到三档之一，判定再拿该档的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(Ac, Re)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 决定整批命运。分类错误会污染后续所有数字，因此它比检验本身更需要事前约定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三类缺陷的定义边界-一句话定义不够用\">三类缺陷的定义边界：一句话定义不够用</h2><p>三方检验机构与标准文献给出的定义高度一致（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acceptable_quality_limit\">Wikipedia: Acceptable quality limit</a>）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>关键/致命缺陷（Critical）</strong>：危及人身安全或违反强制性法规，消费者可能受到伤害或产品本身违法。</li>\n<li><strong>主要缺陷（Major）</strong>：可能导致产品失效，或显著降低其适销性、可用性与可销售性。</li>\n<li><strong>次要缺陷（Minor）</strong>：不影响使用与销售，仅是工艺水准低于规格的外观或手感瑕疵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>定义读起来清楚，落到现场立刻模糊。<strong>&quot;显著降低可用性&quot;是什么量级？<strong>一只保温杯的盖子拧不紧是主要缺陷（漏水、功能失效），杯身有一道 2 毫米的划痕算次要。但&quot;盖子在 60℃ 热水中轻微变形但仍能拧上&quot;落在哪一类？定义不回答这个问题，只有</strong>检验规范（SI, Specification of Inspection）里逐条写死的判定条款</strong>回答。</p>\n<p>实操中把定义转成可执行条款的方法是&quot;三层锚定&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>锚定层</th>\n<th>提问</th>\n<th>保温杯示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>法规锚</td>\n<td>是否触及强制标准或禁售条款？</td>\n<td>内胆不锈钢 304 材质造假、铅镉迁移超标 → 关键</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能锚</td>\n<td>是否让产品无法完成其宣称的功能？</td>\n<td>真空失效导致 2 小时不保温、盖子漏水 → 主要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外观/工艺锚</td>\n<td>是否只影响观感、有可接受上限？</td>\n<td>喷涂色差、注塑流痕、轻微划痕 → 次要</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层是<strong>依次下探</strong>的：先过法规锚（命中即关键，不再往下判），再问功能锚，最后才归入外观。顺序不能颠倒——一个既有划痕又漏水的杯子必须归主要，若先按外观归了次要，整批的判定阈值就被错误抬高了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分级如何驱动抽样-三套-aql-并行运行\">分级如何驱动抽样：三套 AQL 并行运行</h2><p>分级不是标签，它直接改写查表输入。三个缺陷类别各自约定一个 AQL 值，于是<strong>同一个样本量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，有三对不同的接收数/拒收数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(Ac, Re)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>（详见 <a href=\"aql-standard-inspection-level\">AQL 标准与检验水平模型</a>）。跨国买家常见的约定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>缺陷类别</th>\n<th>典型 AQL（高价值品类）</th>\n<th>典型 AQL（中低价值品类）</th>\n<th>现象</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>关键 Critical</td>\n<td>0（零容忍）</td>\n<td>0（零容忍）</td>\n<td>出现 1 件即拒收整批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要 Major</td>\n<td>1.0 / 1.5</td>\n<td>2.5</td>\n<td>抽样中最常触发判退的类别</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次要 Minor</td>\n<td>2.5 / 4.0</td>\n<td>4.0</td>\n<td>阈值宽松，用于控制工艺下限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>（分档取值见第三方检验机构 <a href=\"https://www.v-trust.com/en/our-services/inspection-standards/aql-table\">V-Trust 的 AQL 说明</a>。）这套并行结构有一个必须理解的含义：<strong>三类缺陷是同时抽查同一批样本、各自计数、各自判定</strong>，不是&quot;先挑主要的、次要的先放过&quot;。检验员在 200 件样本上同时记录三个计数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_{c}, d_{m}, d_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只要任一类别触到自己的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Re</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span> 就判该批判退。</p>\n<p>用 OC 曲线看，三类缺陷的&quot;灰色带&quot;完全不同。给定抽样方案 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(n, c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，批次真实不良率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 时被接收的概率为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>c</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac linethickness=\"0px\"><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>d</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) = \\sum_{d=0}^{c} \\binom{n}{d} p^{d} (1-p)^{n-d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9535em;vertical-align:-1.3021em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3021em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\ll N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 时可用泊松近似 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≈</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>c</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">!</mo></mrow></mfrac><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) \\approx \\sum_{d=0}^{c} \\frac{(np)^d}{d!} e^{-np}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4789em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1339em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">!</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\"><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.927em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/pmc/section2/pmc232.htm\">NIST/SEMATECH 工程统计手册 §6.2.3.2</a>）。关键缺陷若严格取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) = (1-p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——<strong>这是把&quot;漏放一个关键缺陷&quot;的概率压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的唯一方向的单调设计</strong>：只有加大 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 或用更好的工艺把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 压低，没有第三条路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"致命缺陷的零容忍-三条实现路径\">致命缺陷的零容忍：三条实现路径</h2><p>标准表里<strong>没有 AQL=0 这一列</strong>，最小列是 0.65（有时是 0.065）。这意味着&quot;关键缺陷零容忍&quot;不能靠查表直接实现，只能三选一：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  C[关键缺陷零容忍&lt;br/&gt;AQL 0 条款] --&gt; P1[路径 A&lt;br/&gt;单列 AQL 0.065&lt;br/&gt;需很大 n 才得 Ac=0]&#10;  C --&gt; P2[路径 B&lt;br/&gt;改用 c=0 抽样方案&lt;br/&gt;抽 n 件出现 1 件即拒收]&#10;  C --&gt; P3[路径 C&lt;br/&gt;该特性 100% 全检&lt;br/&gt;不依赖 AQL 表]&#10;  P1 --&gt; R[写进 SI&lt;br/&gt;检验规范 逐条锁定]&#10;  P2 --&gt; R&#10;  P3 --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; EX[执行: 现场记录 dc&lt;br/&gt;dc 大于等于 1 即判退]\">graph TD\n  C[关键缺陷零容忍&lt;br/&gt;AQL 0 条款] --&gt; P1[路径 A&lt;br/&gt;单列 AQL 0.065&lt;br/&gt;需很大 n 才得 Ac=0]\n  C --&gt; P2[路径 B&lt;br/&gt;改用 c=0 抽样方案&lt;br/&gt;抽 n 件出现 1 件即拒收]\n  C --&gt; P3[路径 C&lt;br/&gt;该特性 100% 全检&lt;br/&gt;不依赖 AQL 表]\n  P1 --&gt; R[写进 SI&lt;br/&gt;检验规范 逐条锁定]\n  P2 --&gt; R\n  P3 --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; EX[执行: 现场记录 dc&lt;br/&gt;dc 大于等于 1 即判退]</pre><p><strong>路径 A（AQL 0.065）</strong> 走标准表的最小列。在样本量字码足够大时，0.065 列会给出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>。例如字码 M（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>315</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 315</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">315</span></span></span></span></span>）在 AQL 0.065 下的接收数就是 0。代价是样本量未必够大——若批量只能抽到字码 G（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">32</span></span></span></span></span>），0.065 列根本给不出方案，表上是向下箭头或无值。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 B（c=0 方案）</strong> 脱离 AQL 列，直接用&quot;抽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 件，出现 1 件即拒收&quot;的零接收数方案。Squeglia 的 c=0 抽样方案把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 和可接受质量水平挂钩，本质是用一条更陡的 OC 曲线换&quot;报告上一目了然的零容忍&quot;（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Acceptance_sampling\">Wikipedia: Acceptance sampling</a>）。它的优点是<strong>语义清晰、仲裁成本低</strong>：报告写&quot;关键缺陷 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Ac = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>&quot;，买卖双方不必再解释 AQL 0.065 和样本量的耦合关系。</p>\n<p><strong>路径 C（全检该特性）</strong> 针对能被自动化或低成本筛查的关键特性——含铅量用 XRF 光谱枪逐件扫、电池用电压表逐件测。此时 AQL 抽样在逻辑上已不适用，条款应写成&quot;该特性 100% 检验，不允许任何不合格品出厂&quot;。</p>\n<p>三条路径的<strong>共同前提</strong>是：SI 必须在检验预约阶段就把关键特性清单锁定，且写清用哪条路径。这份清单是 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/inspection-type-timing-model\">检验类型与时点决策</a> 的产物；现场改清单意味着改合同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分类争议-写-si-时就要消灭的扯皮点\">分类争议：写 SI 时就要消灭的扯皮点</h2><p>现场最耗时的不是检验，是<strong>分类分歧</strong>。同一道划痕，买方代表说主要、工厂说次要，检验员被夹在中间。三个高频争议点及消灭方法：</p>\n<p><strong>其一，外观缺陷的&quot;可见性&quot;标准。</strong>&quot;轻微划痕&quot;到底是多轻？必须写&quot;在 40 厘米、D65 标准光源、无放大镜下 5 秒内可见&quot;这类<strong>可复现的观察条件</strong>。没有观察距离和光照条件，外观分级完全主观。</p>\n<p><strong>其二，缺陷密度与单件计数规则。</strong> 一件产品上有 8 个次要缺陷，算 8 个还是 1 个？主流做法是<strong>按件计</strong>（一件产品同一类别只要出现 ≥1 个缺陷即计 1 件不合格），但必须写在 SI 里。若按个数计，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 时 Ac=10 的次要阈值会被一件密集瑕疵品瞬间填满。</p>\n<p><strong>其三，类别归属的&quot;就近升级&quot;规则。</strong> 一个缺陷同时满足主要和次要特征时归主要；同时满足关键和主要时归关键。这条&quot;从严归属&quot;规则要明文写出——它是防止供应商把关键缺陷&quot;降级&quot;申报的最后一道闸。</p>\n<p>检验规范的力量在于<strong>事前约定</strong>：把分类条款写进 SI 并双方签字，争议就从&quot;谁更有道理&quot;变成&quot;符不符合第 5.3 条&quot;，后者可核查、可复现。样本层面若出现争议品，标准做法是<strong>隔离待议、按最严类别暂计</strong>，由买方 QA 在报告出具前裁决，而不是现场随机分类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的合规红线-分级之上的强制品类\">2026 年的合规红线：分级之上的强制品类</h2><p>有一类关键缺陷不由买卖双方约定——<strong>由法规强制定义为&quot;不允许出现&quot;</strong>，分级宽松的空间在这里被压缩到零。跨境卖家必须知道两条在 2026 年生效的硬约束：</p>\n<p><strong>美国 CPSC 电子申报（eFiling）。</strong> 美国消费品安全委员会要求进口受管制消费品的<strong>合规证书（Certificate of Compliance）通过 ACE 系统电子申报</strong>，一般要求自 <strong>2026 年 7 月 8 日</strong>起生效，同日修订后的 <strong>16 CFR part 1110</strong> 还要求申报所依赖的<strong>测试排除项</strong>；进入或从<strong>对外贸易区（FTZ）<strong>提取消费/仓储的货物，要求自 <strong>2027 年 1 月 8 日</strong>起生效（<a href=\"https://www.cpsc.gov/FAQ/eFiling-Frequently-Asked-FAQ\">CPSC eFiling FAQ</a>）。三条与检验直接相关的细节：证书针对</strong>已受某一 CPSC 规则/禁令/标准管制的成品</strong>；<strong>没有 Section 321 小额豁免</strong>——任何需要证书的产品无论货值多少都必须电子申报证书；CPSC 初期不因缺少电子申报数据而要求 CBP 拒绝入境，会先发<strong>警告</strong>，但<strong>底层的证书合规要求照常执行，仍可能查扣不合规产品</strong>。对 PSI 的含义是：关键缺陷清单必须包含&quot;是否具备有效合规证书与依赖的测试报告&quot;，缺证本身就是拒收项。</p>\n<p><strong>欧盟通用产品安全条例（GPSR, (EU) 2023/988）。</strong> 该条例自 <strong>2024 年 12 月 13 日</strong>起适用（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/General_Product_Safety_Regulation\">GPSR</a>）。<strong>第 5 条</strong>要求经营者确保产品安全并进行<strong>内部风险分析</strong>，覆盖设计、材料、预期用途、可预见误用、脆弱用户群体，以及机械、化学、热、电、卫生、辐射等危害，并要求<strong>按严重程度对风险分级、记录缓解措施</strong>；<strong>第 9(5)–(7) 条</strong>要求产品带标识、制造商名称与联系方式，且说明书/安全信息使用销售地成员国语言；<strong>第 18 条</strong>要求技术文档（含风险评估与测试证据）随时可向监管机构提供；<strong>第 32–36 条</strong>要求严重风险在<strong>两个工作日内</strong>上报并通过 EU Safety Gate 协调。非欧盟制造商必须指定欧盟境内的进口商、分销商或授权代表持有技术文档——若无指定，<strong>进口商或分销商自动承担产品合规的法律责任</strong>。</p>\n<p>这两条法规把&quot;关键缺陷&quot;从合同概念升级为<strong>准入概念</strong>：一个未通过 CPSIA 铅含量测试或缺少 GPSR 风险分析文档的产品，在现场检验里连&quot;缺陷&quot;都算不上——它根本不该出厂。SI 应把法规符合性作为<strong>独立于 AQL 的前置门</strong>：先验证书与测试报告，再进抽样。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分级决定通道，不是描述瑕疵</strong>：关键/主要/次要三类各自绑定一个 AQL 和一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>c</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(Ac, Re)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在同一批样本上同时计数、各自判退，任一类别触线即整批判退。</li>\n<li><strong>三层锚定顺序不可颠倒</strong>：法规锚（命中即关键）→ 功能锚（不能完成宣称功能即主要）→ 外观锚（仅观感影响即次要）。先按外观归类会把阈值错误放宽。</li>\n<li><strong>OC 曲线说明 AQL 不是质量承诺</strong>：关键缺陷取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_a(p) = (1-p)^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，只有加大样本量或压低工艺不良率才能降低漏放概率。</li>\n<li><strong>零容忍有三条实现路径</strong>：单列 AQL 0.065（受样本量制约）、c=0 抽样方案（语义清晰）、关键特性 100% 全检（不依赖 AQL 表）。三条都必须在 SI 里事前锁定。</li>\n<li><strong>争议要在 SI 里消灭</strong>：写死观察条件（距离/光源/时长）、单件计数规则、类别&quot;从严归属&quot;规则；现场争议品隔离待议、按最严类别暂计，由买方 QA 裁决。</li>\n<li><strong>2026 年两条法规红线</strong>：CPSC eFiling 一般要求 2026-07-08 生效、无小额豁免、缺电子申报先警告但证书合规照常执行；EU GPSR 自 2024-12-13 适用，第 5 条强制风险分级、第 32–36 条两工作日内上报。合规符合性是独立于 AQL 的前置门。</li>\n<li>分级与抽样方案定下后，如何按交期窗口预约并执行检验，见 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/inspection-booking-lead-time-window\">检验预约的交期窗口</a> 与 <a href=\"../psi-timing-stage/onsite-reschedule-abort-exception\">现场延期、改期与中止的处置</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"缺陷分级判定：致命/严重/轻微缺陷的实操界定","id":"缺陷分级判定-致命-严重-轻微缺陷的实操界定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三类缺陷的定义边界：一句话定义不够用","id":"三类缺陷的定义边界-一句话定义不够用"},{"level":2,"text":"分级如何驱动抽样：三套 AQL 并行运行","id":"分级如何驱动抽样-三套-aql-并行运行"},{"level":2,"text":"致命缺陷的零容忍：三条实现路径","id":"致命缺陷的零容忍-三条实现路径"},{"level":2,"text":"分类争议：写 SI 时就要消灭的扯皮点","id":"分类争议-写-si-时就要消灭的扯皮点"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的合规红线：分级之上的强制品类","id":"2026-年的合规红线-分级之上的强制品类"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抽样方案机制：批量、样本量与 Ac/Re 判定计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/aql-sampling-plan/sampling-plan-ac-re-calculation"},"next":{"title":"监装方案与装柜计划模型：柜型、堆码与装载率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/preshipment-inspection-psl-aql/loading-supervision/container-loading-plan-model"}}